<title>USA: Travelers unit sells $250 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Travelers unit sells $250 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue</p>
<p>from Smith Barney Holdings was priced on Monday, according to</p>
<p>lead manager Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Holdings is a unit of Travelers Group Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER SMITH BARNEY HOLDINGS</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 7.00 PCT   MATURITY 3/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.759  FIRST PAY DATE  9/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 7.044 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 53 BPS     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>(( -- U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678 ))</p>
